WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.437
An ablation isolates the contribution of each
fine-tuning stage.

00:00:04.517 --> 00:00:06.907
Starting from the Qwen-VL baseline,

00:00:06.987 --> 00:00:11.636
adding only reasoning tuning improves country and
city F1 modestly.

00:00:11.716 --> 00:00:15.588
Adding only location tuning produces a much larger jump,

00:00:15.668 --> 00:00:18.553
especially at the fine-grained city level,

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:23.352
confirming that location tuning is essential for
pinpointing cities.

00:00:23.432 --> 00:00:28.293
But the full model, with both stages stacked, is
the strongest of all,

00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:34.221
reaching a country F1 of zero point nine zero and a
city F1 of zero point eight six.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:39.091
The two stages are complementary: location tuning
supplies precision,

00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:43.820
reasoning tuning supplies explanations and a
further accuracy lift.
